SUMMARY:Deadline: Burning Man: BRC Honoraria Art Grants 2027 (Letter of Int
 ent)
DESCRIPTION:Grants for large-scale interactive installation art shown at Bl
 ack Rock City 2027\; much of the funded work is creative-tech\, light and 
 kinetic. Two-stage process: a Letter of Intent now\, with invited full pro
 posals due mid-January 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Burning Man Project\nLocatio
 n: Black Rock City\, Nevada\, USA (artwork installed at the 2027 event). O
 pen internationally to individuals and collectives\; artist attendance is 
 recommended but not required.\nAward: USD 1.5 million annual art-grant bud
 get across approximately 75 projects\; grants fund 40 to 60% of the propos
 ed total budget\, and the official page notes grants over USD 20\,000 are 
 rare. No fixed per-award figure is published. No application fee.\nDuratio
 n: Per project (build for the 2027 event)\n\nMore: https://burningman.org/
 black-rock-city/bring-your-art/art-grants-programs/brc-honoraria/?utm_sour
 ce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
