DTSTAMP:20261104T150309Z
DTSTART:20261201T042900Z
DTEND:20261201T045900Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 EST: Beam Center: 2027 Beam Camp Project Open Call (
 USD 5\,000 commission\, remote-friendly)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 30 Nov 2026 at 23:59 EST.\n\nAnnual design commission fo
 r an ambitious\, technically challenging large-scale public artwork or str
 ucture\, built over summer 2027 by more than 100 young people working with
  Beam staff. The selected designer collaborates through bi-weekly remote p
 lanning meetings and may visit the build with travel reimbursed\, making t
 his genuinely remote-friendly for a physical commission.\n\nOrganisation: 
 Beam Center\nLocation: Brooklyn\, New York\, USA (organisation)\; the work
  is built in Strafford\, New Hampshire by 100+ youth. Designer collaborate
 s remotely\; optional site visit with travel reimbursed. Open worldwide\, 
 any age\, individuals or teams.\nAward: USD 5\,000 award to the selected p
 roposer\, plus a fabrication budget of approximately USD 15\,000. No appli
 cation fee.\nDuration: Design phase plus summer 2027 build\n\nMore: https:
 //www.beamcenter.org/events/2027-beam-camp-project-call-3bpb9?utm_source=a
 rtificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.beamcenter.org/events/2027-beam-camp-project-call-3bpb9?utm
 _source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Brooklyn\, New York\, USA (organisation)\; the work is built in St
 rafford\, New Hampshire by 100+ youth. Designer collaborates remotely\; op
 tional site visit with travel reimbursed. Open worldwide\, any age\, indiv
 iduals or teams.
END:VEVENT
