SUMMARY:Deadline: FAI Conservative AI Policy Fellowship\, Winter 2027 (Wash
 ington DC\, part-time\, USD 1\,500 stipend)
DESCRIPTION:The Foundation for American Innovation's Conservative AI Policy
  Fellowship is an eight-week\, part-time\, work-compatible programme on AI
  policy for conservative policy professionals in Washington DC.\n\nOrganis
 ation: Foundation for American Innovation (FAI)\nLocation: FAI office on C
 apitol Hill\, Washington DC\, USA (in person).\nAward: USD 1\,500 stipend 
 for eligible fellows (government employees should check with their ethics 
 office)\, with meals and retreat expenses covered. No application fee.\nDu
 ration: 8 weeks part-time\, 19 January to 12 March 2027 (about 2-3 hours a
  week plus a required weekend retreat in February).\n\nMore: https://www.t
 hefai.org/fellowships?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=ref
 erral
URL:https://www.thefai.org/fellowships?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
 k&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:FAI office on Capitol Hill\, Washington DC\, USA (in person).
END:VEVENT
